>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must not be Char/int8 to avoid "elu_cpu not implemented for 'Char'")
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 1
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must be floating point)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8)
>>
Rule 3 (inplace flag is a boolean)
{v_2 : bool} |= v_2 = true ∨ v_2 = false
>>
Rule 4 (all tensor dimensions are non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 5 (if inplace is used, restrict to widely supported float dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : bool} |= if v_2 then (dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8)
